Resolution: Built slide-up cookie disclaimer with granular privacy settings, full client-side retail metrics event stream capturing telemetry across cart/checkout/views/search, and a unified CMS & Inventory Management ledger with live stock adjustments, SKU creation/editing, and cloud bucket sync simulation.

